System Design Perspective
In large systems such as WhatsApp, Amazon, or Google-scale applications, SOLID helps isolate
business logic, improve testing, reduce deployment risks, and enable independent evolution of
components. Combined with design patterns, clean architecture, and microservices, SOLID forms
the foundation of maintainable enterprise software.
